  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>About: Unattended executor. HTTP GET NPCI_Queue_url -&gt; parse items (keys rrn, amount, status/decision, rail,&#xd;&#xa;breakCategory/action, epc, accNo, dossierId) -&gt; keep APPROVED / AUTO_APPROVED / VERIFIED NETC double-debit refunds -&gt;&#xd;&#xa;POST /api/hitl/approve?txn_id=&amp;approver=AE_NETC_WALLET_BOT&amp;notes= (backend posts the wallet reversal credit) -&gt; capture the updated ledger balance&#xd;&#xa;from the response (updatedBalance / newBalance / balance) -&gt; return HTTP 200 execution status with the balance.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Config params: NPCI_Queue_url (default http://localhost:8000/api/hitl/queue), WALLET_CORE_API_URL, OUTPUT_DIR. Runtime: none.&#xd;&#xa;Errors: invalid config, queue unreachable / non-2xx, wallet core unreachable / rejected are all normalised into&#xd;&#xa;NETC_Wallet_Reversal_Audit_&lt;ts&gt;.xlsx (attached to the result) and summarised into one result (Failure 400 / 502, partial 207, success 200).</note>
      <xloc>64</xloc>
      <yloc>760</yloc>
